{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "fc8df28b4927315b037decae71bd2e87f2cf2ee864fabe792789ecce1e39955f", "ja": "手作りのセットリスト", "zh": "手工制作的曲目单", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8783c2abd26c44a0d98b4cdbaef91d11e74847b491770f9eb614acdf72a68e19", "ja": "レッスン初日。プロデューサーから新曲を\n受け取った翼は、自分たちで公演のセット\nリストを考えようと提案する。翼の前向きな\n姿勢がメンバー全員の意欲を高めていき、\nリーダーらしく、皆を引っ張っていく。", "zh": "课程第一天。翼从制作人那里\n拿到了新歌，提议由大家自己来考虑公演的歌单。\n翼积极向前的态度逐渐鼓舞了全体成员的干劲，\n展现出领导者的风范，带领大家一同前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0e37993508337361858e65385024909d370d50296c9499791b8fa52d6754ddc3", "ja": "レッスン初日……", "zh": "课程第一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "abd9380bc30b94ddb145bbc59032d1bcd1fc539f21e87e475d82665a59c6e17c", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　いよいよ今日から\nツアーに向けてのレッスンだな。よろしく！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！从今天开始终于要为巡演进行训练了。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "d093e75dcac6bac1832e0d97a6fa4634750feb86219d47d74e94ed6b0fbd3435", "ja": "よろしくね、{$P$}！\nやっぱいいよね、ツアーって。なんか楽しみ♪", "zh": "请多关照啦，{$P$}！\n果然还是巡演好啊。总觉得让人期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4448ffb48f82260f953ff7367cf26d1c04ecf66aa445f8211b9466022f0f2d37", "ja": "はは、やる気満々だな。その調子で頼む！\nおっと、レッスンの前にこれを配らないとな。", "zh": "哈哈，干劲十足嘛。就保持这个状态，拜托了！\n对了，在开始练习前，得先把这个发下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "bb6549c4f3c7e60d9cbe846577c858bd771fce5b337a51c981b32bf78337b442", "ja": "これは……レッスン用の楽曲、でしょうか？", "zh": "这是……用于练习的乐曲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "112c25f69acfb4a7d7fc0e000c37177bece32ecb148dacedad841ff4c8b51c81", "ja": "ああ。セットリストはまだ決めきれていないんだけど、\nラインナップはここにあるもので行こうと思ってる。", "zh": "嗯。虽然还没完全决定曲目单，\n但演出阵容我打算就用这里列出的这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e0a4c34a668c678bdf336eaa35c0bce80cb4f92cc5d2bf2ace44605afc43662f", "ja": "えっ？　……{$P$}さん！\n今回のツアーって、新曲あるんですか！？", "zh": "诶？……{$P$}先生！\n这次巡演有新歌吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c7b4a0dcc44958706d17d1dc1c0239967e11b9c846f43bde8cff392fa332aa75", "ja": "もちろん！　ちょうど、ついさっき届いたんだ。\nせっかくだから、みんなで聴いてみるか。", "zh": "当然有！刚才正好送到了。\n机会难得，大家一起听听看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_1008", "source_sha256": "3a08e80bb4091b29875286f3dcc5c6fce4663584f917292a1b56a6de51ebbdcc", "ja": "曲を流す", "zh": "播放乐曲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8f625f274e16db294aedc94ab8eb1ae1730ed1a90279b99ecfd5a4189fb2d672", "ja": "わぁ～、すっごくカッコイイ！\nわたし、こういう曲大好き！", "zh": "哇～，太帅气了！\n我最喜欢这种歌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2002_021mat", "source_sha256": "d0e4a299f712d568707b54b6a487d055c9728e4448c7a734ccf69cb3b8ecd960", "ja": "そーくーる！な曲で、素敵なのです。\nよかったですね、翼ちゃん♪", "zh": "是首“超酷”的歌，真棒呢。翼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4ff1670e4dc6c0e3ca8b576d71b34b4ec8ca2fca82a34b58077b1aa7385c51f2", "ja": "はい！　早くライブで歌いたいな～♪", "zh": "是！好想早点在演唱会上唱这首歌啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2004_020meg", "source_sha256": "9a23c91f078fbfb35c1209e632256ae358e6aa18c5c4a8ed62829a478563eea2", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}。この曲と全体曲の\n演出で、イイ感じにギャップが作れそうじゃない？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。用这首歌和全员曲的演出，应该能营造出很棒的反差吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2005_p", "source_sha256": "baa428c9f3391dc58e4832e07c29b5dc49ee371b2bfd88d7f0c5744eea970993", "ja": "そうだな。ライブにも緩急がついて\n面白くなりそうだ。となると、曲順は……。", "zh": "是啊。这样一来，演唱会的节奏也能张弛有度，应该会变得更有意思。这样的话，歌曲顺序就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2007_p", "source_sha256": "0326a413b1af7108f18a1cb77356ea803d5b16d70dfa215ddde2954c98cceeaa", "ja": "おっと、すまない。電話か……取引先からだな。\nしばらく外すよ。まつり、貴音、後を頼めるか？", "zh": "哦，抱歉。是电话……客户打来的。我要暂时离开一下。祭、贵音，之后就拜托你们了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2008_008tak", "source_sha256": "139573a5c607cf8325437ec9d69b17170bc1827e6f2e3dc89f5f71dbc87e94ad", "ja": "かしこまりました。", "zh": "明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2009_021mat", "source_sha256": "eba66db9722b6e9d1c16475b6deeaa2dbad47d5b29c5fa302ab0190c4115d262", "ja": "はいなのです。\nここは、姫たちにおまかせなのです♪", "zh": "是的。\n这里就交给我们这些公主吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8c5a05cc1d1a50f662b2ec677c25683b177f0cd0ee9b112a06623ad07e45656c", "ja": "もー、{$P$}さん！　なんで\nリーダーのわたしにまかせてくれないんですか？", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生！为什么不把这件事交给身为队长的我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2011_p", "source_sha256": "e33d3d8bc71a83d4b2ebe82785669fe1a86aa09a77fd7d7429b38f0854439f9b", "ja": "あ、ごめん。リーダーは翼だけど\nまつりは年上だし、貴音はみんなより先輩だからな。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。虽然队长是翼，不过小祭比你们年长，而且贵音也是比大家资历更深的前辈嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2012_020meg", "source_sha256": "5638922aad61a774148a278872856abfc9d0272879250f9ed1b97a44eb5f8509", "ja": "まあまあ、翼はアタシと一緒に\nお子ちゃま組でいようよ♪　にゃはは♪", "zh": "好啦好啦，翼就和我一起待在小孩子组吧♪　呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b3ce73a5091a701e6c9bd4e8571e01f4e6e1e1c784628d14c9e8811120095470", "ja": "むー……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2014_020meg", "source_sha256": "1681b557763a70b9b6f6834b7bf1dfc94cd83adf569a85dbbe73cd58652120fe", "ja": "いやー。にしても{$P$}、\n相変わらず忙しそうだよね～。", "zh": "不是啦。不过话说回来，{$P$}还是一如既往地忙呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2015_008tak", "source_sha256": "0dcaa3ca3bafdd4f0380cd86f9db40d036d0ce2f24da3c738c02c07578047cfd", "ja": "そうですね。このツアーの準備以外にも、\n様々な業務を抱えているでしょうし……。", "zh": "是啊。除了准备这次巡演之外，应该还承担着各种各样的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f978fd315863fc427a1bc2dd2e4b609baed1a30f585cc4b53324db951cbe5e48", "ja": "……あの！　さっき{$P$}さん、\nセットリストはまだ決めてないって言ってましたよね？", "zh": "……那个！刚才{$P$}先生说过，歌单还没决定对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c3f535043c9755d368d178d1d63a43ee1f5d8748412a4fc3328845ff94875a6b", "ja": "だったら、曲順、わたしたちで考えてみませんか？", "zh": "既然这样，歌曲顺序要不要由我们来想想看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2018_020meg", "source_sha256": "ffeb7f751ebddaf4a53c5462e1d5d4c881644daa8bfcf02ebad4d7eeded4f800", "ja": "えっ！？　……けど、いいのかな？\nアタシたちだけで進めちゃって。", "zh": "诶！？……可是，这样真的好吗？\n就由我们自己推进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2019_008tak", "source_sha256": "d67873adca169b4837c448e84cf21214dcb784c044bda5f5efff746c53048328", "ja": "そうですね……{$P$}の意向を、\nまだはっきりと聞けていないのに。", "zh": "是啊……明明还没能明确听到{$P$}的意向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2020_021mat", "source_sha256": "c66bd8c7557b203af089841e6db2c1e73800395ae0c82d57f2c6782156a9fb2d", "ja": "姫は、翼ちゃんの提案に賛成なのです！", "zh": "公主赞成翼的提议哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2021_021mat", "source_sha256": "2e7d61964555623580fd7238e746a3ed2d5232d89977f862f4b477c2e55f0a16", "ja": "それに、これはまだ仮のリストなのです。\nなので、そのとおりになるとは限らないのです！", "zh": "而且，这还只是暂定名单。\n所以，也不一定会完全按这个来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2022_020meg", "source_sha256": "5336f650c481a458973d833cd349d6f964ef375c84f58fda70182ec9374b21e3", "ja": "あ、そっか。ならアタシたちで、\nいったん組んでみるのもアリかも？", "zh": "啊，这样啊。那我们先自己试着组一下，也不是不可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e0c0e477511e2f6eb959742bebf745e67b1d1f3566cd03f6d4b1713dd8b788f9", "ja": "そうですよ♪　作ってみてダメなら、\nまたみんなで考えればいいですし！", "zh": "就是嘛♪要是做出来发现不行，再和大家一起想办法就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2024_008tak", "source_sha256": "8589fbd4acaf5c8eb421e684221dfd4ab88ac246f150ae2d6f6ba0c4d76626e7", "ja": "こうした相談ができるのも、劇場の良さのひとつ……\nならば、皆で考えてみる事にいたしましょう。", "zh": "能像这样一起商量，也是剧场的优点之一……\n那么，就让我们大家一起想想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2025_p", "source_sha256": "a8364bd73da478e899620345d26fc52ae55824d92eb0df9b15f81a76daf58796", "ja": "みんなごめん、遅くなった……\nあれ？　何してるんだ。", "zh": "抱歉大家，我来晚了……\n咦？你们在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7d5b3f3a4af991adcc7af2d96ea851b2385023a14ea87c01845346e9aa9ec38f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　今、みんなで\nツアーのセットリストを考えてたんです。どうですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！我们刚才正在一起商量巡演的演出曲目顺序。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2027_p", "source_sha256": "553074b442b1e95ede7489b17be5cafb8757d773ee26cb8911081bd5b66f89bd", "ja": "セットリストを？　どれどれ……\nおっ、結構いい線行ってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "关于演出曲目表？我看看……\n\n哦，做得相当不错嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2028_p", "source_sha256": "0ab745973d3a154dc030d263b7a77454793909d90e01ea4d0d9a35beb3e7f9c2", "ja": "後は、序盤にもう少し意外性を持たせて……うん、\n少し手直ししたら行けそうだ！　すごいじゃないか。", "zh": "剩下的只要在开局阶段再加点意外性……嗯，\n稍微修改一下就行得通了！很不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27f0a9783a2e15aec66649a6e18b7b55e1e94d432876fe62bcce9119e37fbb6f", "ja": "えへへっ、本当ですか！　やった～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的吗！太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2030_p", "source_sha256": "004b86e7e07bc3ea05adb9f77fe8d4dee13a7d7ec0fe9967e4346deccd15492f", "ja": "ありがとうな、翼。みんなも。\nこの案は、大事に預からせてもらうよ。", "zh": "谢谢你，翼。也谢谢大家。\n这个方案，我会好好保管的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7bf914c3590122379bd966d78d5029f1090602fec6782f0de0519056200148ab", "ja": "よろしくお願いしま～す！\nそれじゃ改めて、レッスンがんばりましょ～！", "zh": "那就拜托啦～！\n那么我们重新打起精神，一起努力练习吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2032_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2033_020meg", "source_sha256": "d80b2618aecfc01b158857c1dc679faf545614638ce2927e24f63a21b2d60dcd", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}。\nレッスンルームの鍵、返しに来たよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n我是来归还练习室钥匙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2034_p", "source_sha256": "b1d5eeb6f149a4b67632d995707b5b6b6600f5e0a2c8313d484b21ac330eee84", "ja": "恵美、それから貴音も。\n遅い時間までお疲れ様！", "zh": "惠美，还有贵音也是。\n辛苦你们练到这么晚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2035_p", "source_sha256": "c59bce5aeba2448569ed0be497061827b7219f235571ef22181055ea2a3769b1", "ja": "そうだ、ふたりに聞いておきたいんだけど……\n翼のリーダー、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "对了，有件事想问问你们两个……\n翼当队长，应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2036_008tak", "source_sha256": "34c5db9717a1cb5761f97215608570911cf768a8e58ede87bfee5f9eefdd7680", "ja": "はい、しっかりと務めを果たしているかと。\n皆、翼の熱意に当てられ、やる気になっています。", "zh": "是的，我想她应该很好地履行着自己的职责。\n大家都受到了翼的热情感染，也都干劲十足了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2037_020meg", "source_sha256": "ca809187d5d0781637fa5fdf4e798837e2c428f1efcd02edc9816645a049b967", "ja": "うんうん！　なんか、アタシたちのほうが翼に\n引っ張られてるって感じ？　新鮮で結構楽しいよ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！感觉反倒是我们被翼带着走了？这种新鲜感还挺有意思的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2038_020meg", "source_sha256": "e9d21eada69fde3cdba2e9ad0d293eaaf15716cb862cfd5c572ab43cef24f757", "ja": "あとは、まつりが結構いい感じなんだよね。\nうまく翼をサポートしてるっていうか？", "zh": "还有就是，茉莉的表现也挺不错的呢。\n该说是很好地支援了翼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2039_p", "source_sha256": "b1f82daf3b10b578df27b77789c035bdea32b99da16127b15e461c2f88d6bab2", "ja": "まつりが……そうか。それを聞いて、安心したよ。\n引き続き、よろしく頼むな。", "zh": "祭典……这样啊。听你这么说，我就放心了。\n接下来也拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2040_008tak", "source_sha256": "433f06be98778f84e54746dffe82e660aebc162affb6bcd790777f7ad18d2fe2", "ja": "はい。私達も、負けてはいられません。\nツアー成功に向けて、精進して参ります。", "zh": "好的。我们也不能输。\n为了巡演成功，我们会继续努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2041_020meg", "source_sha256": "225fad8221bf4d9753c5f7dc9b25dbd76ec90050816094c5401c9b3bfdbc31af", "ja": "うんっ！　アタシも、まだまだがんばるよ！　あ、でも\n{$P$}は、無理しないようにね？", "zh": "嗯！我也会继续努力的！啊，不过{$P$}先生，你可别太勉强自己哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_03_2042_p", "source_sha256": "9ca368bc5eff67ddaf90f98c7fe002b81c714c5be6896cf9c382eab5b2187c05", "ja": "（レッスンも順調。翼も、リーダーとして\nかなり頑張っている……これは期待できそうだな）", "zh": "（练习进行得很顺利。翼作为队长也相当努力……看来值得期待啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
